# Bench image build context (stress/docker/Dockerfile*) only needs the
# workspace manifests + apps/ + packages/ source. Everything else bloats the
# context transfer — worst on macOS, where the Docker daemon lives in a VM and
# the whole context crosses the socket at every build.

node_modules/
**/node_modules/

.git/
.lavish/
.stress/
test-results/
playwright-report/
stress/locust/.venv/
stress/locust/*.log
stress/docker/.run.err
apps/e2e/test-results/
apps/e2e/playwright-report/

*.log
dist/
coverage/